{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"3JN","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约翰三书","commonName":"约翰三书","title":"约翰三书","order":64,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"210bc822a366a78b58086e91d4458bb03754a976c10739c838cd0c4b66c6e3b3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/3JN/1.json","lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/3JN/1.json","totalNumberOfVerses":15},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我这做长老的写信给亲爱的该犹，你是我本着真理所爱的人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["亲爱的弟兄，我愿你凡事顺利，身体像灵魂一样健康。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["该犹的好品行"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["一些弟兄来为你做见证，说你忠心地遵行真理，这使我非常欢喜。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["没有比听见自己的孩子遵行真理更使我欢喜了。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["亲爱的弟兄，你常常忠心地照顾素不相识的弟兄，"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他们把你的爱心告诉了教会。愿你照着上帝喜悦的方式继续帮助他们出行，"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["因为他们为了主的名四处传道，不接受非信徒的任何帮助。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["我们理当接待这样的人，好成为他们传扬真理的同工。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["丢特腓的恶行"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我曾写信给你那里的教会，但爱当头领的丢特腓不接待我们。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["因此，我若去你们那里，必揭露他的所作所为，他怎样恶言中伤我们。不仅如此，他还拒绝接待弟兄，并且禁止别人接待，甚至将接待的人赶出教会。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["抑恶扬善"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["亲爱的弟兄，不要效法罪恶，要效法美善。行善的人属于上帝，行恶的人不认识上帝。"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["低米丢得到了众人的好评，真理也为他做见证，我们也为他做见证。你知道我们的见证是真实的。"]},{"type":"heading","content":["结语"]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":["我还有许多事要告诉你，但不想借助笔墨，"]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":["只希望很快见到你，跟你当面畅谈。"]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":["愿你平安！这里的朋友们都问候你，请代我一一问候你那边的朋友。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/3JN/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JUD/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/2JN/1.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}